    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kɔ̱a̱l ruath dääpä",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mëë wä naath ɛ nɛn i̱ ci Muthɛ jääny wi̱i̱ pa̱a̱m, cukɛ rɔ̱ ma̱a̱t, bäkɛ kä Ä-ron, cukɛ jɛ ben jiök i̱, “Bër, täthni kɔ kuth ti bi ja̱l nhiamda, ti ba kɔ bo̱th. Ɛn wut ɛ cɔal i̱ Muthɛ mi, mëë käm kɔ raar muun I-jëp, kueckɔ mɔ ci tuɔɔk kä jɛ mɔ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ä-ron kɛ jiök i̱, “Yɛn ka̱mɛ tiil dääpä tɔ̱ te ji̱thni määnkun tɔ̱ raar, kɛnɛ tɔ̱ te ji̱thni gankun tɔ̱, kɛ tɔ̱ te ji̱thni nyieetkun tɔ̱, nöŋɛ kɛ ɣä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu nɛy diaal tiil da̱a̱pni tëë te ji̱thnikiɛn ka̱m raar, cukɛ kɛ nöŋ Ä-ron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ da̱a̱p käp te̱tnikiɛn, cuɛ jɛ thal, kä cuɛ jɛ la̱th guäth mi cɛ täth ala ruath, kä cuɛ ben raar ala ruath tha̱a̱k, kä cukɛ wee i̱, “Ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, ti̱ti̱ kɛ kɛn kuthku tëë ka̱mkɛ ji̱ raar muun I-jëp.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mëë wä Ä-ron ɛ nɛn inɛ, cuɛ täth nhiamdɛ, kä cuɛ ruac kɛ naath cuɛ wee i̱, “Iruun banɛ Kuoth Nhial lät kä mi̱th tɛthä lɔaac.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cukɛ ke̱e̱r ni kɛ runwaŋ ɛlɔ̱ŋ. Cukɛ luuri ti waŋkɛ näk, kä cukɛ luuri malä no̱o̱ŋ, cu naath nyuur mi̱thkɛ, kä mäthkɛ, kä cukɛ kac nhial kɛ ra̱w.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial Muthɛ jiök i̱, “Wër piny ni kä kɛɛl kɛ ɣöö kɛn nɛɛku tëë no̱o̱ŋi raar muun I-jëp cikɛ ciaaŋdiɛn ya̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niɛ guäth ɛ tɔt ɛ cikɛ rɔ̱ ku thuŋ buɔ̱k dup ëë cä guɔ̱k kɛ. Cikɛ rɔ̱ ta̱th ruath tha̱a̱k, mi la palkɛ ɛ kɛn, kä na̱a̱kɛ jɛ kä ŋɔaani, bikɛ wee i̱, ‘Yɛn ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, ti̱ti̱ kɛ kɛn kuthku tëë ka̱mkɛ ji̱ raar muun I-jëp.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ Muthɛ jiök i̱, “Ɣän cä nɛy ti̱ti̱ thuk kɛ guec, kɛ nɛy ti bum wuɔ̱thkiɛn ɛ tet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ ɛmɔ gue̱nyni ɣä gua̱a̱th mi bä wi̱cdä car kɛ jɛ, kä ɣän bä kɛ puɔ̱k ɛ puɔ̱k, kä ji̱n puɔ̱ɔ̱nydu bä do̱r mi di̱i̱t cak kɛ ji̱.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Muthɛ Kuoth Nhial Kuothdɛ läŋ, cuɛ wee i̱, “Aɣ Kuoth Nhial, ɛŋu bi waŋ lɔaacdu rɔɔdɛ re̱p kɛ nɛɛku mɔ, kɛn nɛy tëë käm ni ji̱n raar muun I-jëp, kɛ lua̱ŋ mi di̱i̱t kɛnɛ tetdu mi bum? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ɛŋu dëë ji̱ I-jëp ɛ laar ɔ i̱, ci Kuothdiɛn kɛ no̱o̱ŋ raar kɛ ca̱p, kɛ ɣöö bɛ kɛ ben nor wi̱i̱ pa̱a̱m kä bɛ kɛ cu puɔ̱k wi̱i̱ muɔ̱ɔ̱n? Päl waaŋ lɔaacdu mɔ di̱i̱t ɛmɔ, kä nyɔk wi̱cdu kɛ ca̱r kɛ mi jiääk ɛ dëë ben kä nɛɛku mi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tim A-bɛ-ram, kä tim Ay-dhɛk kɛnɛ I-thɛ-rɛl tin la la̱a̱tku, tëë ci rɔ yac nhiamdiɛn kɛ puɔ̱nydu pa̱ny. Curi kɛ jiök i̱, ‘Ɣän bä kuaykun jak kä di̱ethkɛ rɔ̱, a bikɛ ce̱tkɛ kuɛl nhial, kä ɛn mun ɛ di̱i̱t ɛmɛ kɛɛliw cä jɛ ka̱m kuaykun, mi ba ka̱n ɛ kɛn ala duundiɛn amäni ciaŋ.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Kuoth Nhial wi̱cdɛ car kɛ päl kä mi jiääk in ɛ jɛn i̱ lätdɛ kä nɛɛkɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Muthɛ rɔɔdɛ ri̱t, cuɛ ben piny wi̱i̱ pa̱a̱m jälɛ kɛ pääm da̱ŋ rɛw tin pat paat tin la nyin lueekni, tin ca gak kɛ gɔ̱a̱r kui̱cnikiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw diaal, kui̱c ɔ kɛnɛ kui̱c ɔ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛn pääm tɔ̱tɔ̱ lät kɛ ni Kuoth inɔ. Gɔ̱a̱riɛn gɔ̱rɛ ni Kuoth puɔ̱nydɛ, ca kɛ rël jɔk päämni tɔ̱ pat paat tɔ̱tɔ̱. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë wä Jɔ-cua jɔw nath liŋ, kɛ rɔaliɛn mi di̱i̱t, cuɛ Muthɛ jiök i̱, “Ci ko̱r nyiëëny rɛy wec.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Muthɛ ɛ Jiök i̱, “Nɔmɔ /ciɛ rɔal mi ce̱t joc ji̱kɛ naath, kä /ciɛ rɔal mi ce̱t juɔckɛ ni ji̱kɛ, liɛŋä ni rɔal nɛɛni ti ci wi̱cdiɛn kac kɔaŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë wäkɛ wec ŋäth ikä niɛ wa̱nɔ, cu Muthɛ ruath nɛn, kɛnɛ naath ti duɔ̱thkɛ bul. Cu Muthɛ kɛ̈c a bɛ rɔ̱ɔ̱th. Cuɛ kɛn pääm tin pat paat tin kɔn yuɔr piny a bikɛ töl ɛn wan ɔ thaar pa̱a̱m. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ruath tha̱a̱k in ca täth ɛ kɛn ka̱n, kä cuɛ jɛ pɛt, kä cuɛ jɛ nor ɛ ba tup, kä cuɛ jɛ wɛ̈r pi̱i̱ni, kä cuɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl jak kä mathkɛ jɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Muthɛ Ä-ron ku jiök i̱, “Ci nɛy ɛ ti ji̱ la̱t i̱di, mɔ curi kɛ buath dui̱rä mi duŋ di̱i̱t ɔ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Ä-ron wee i̱, “Kuäärä, a lɔcdu /cɛ weŋ ɣä, ji̱n puɔ̱nydu ŋäci nɛy ti̱ti̱ pe̱kdiɛn ɛn ɣöö kɛ ji̱ wieecni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ɣöö kɛ kɛn la̱r kɛ jɛ ɣä tɔ̱ i̱, ‘Täthni kɔ kuth ti bia̱ te nhiamda, mi cak a Muthɛ ëë käm kɔ raar muun I-jëp, ci mɔ ci tuɔɔk kä jɛ mɔ wi̱cda yi̱c.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua kɛ jiök i̱, ‘A ram ɔ tekɛ da̱a̱p ɔ ŋun jɛ, cukɛ kɛ cu nöŋ ɣä, cua kɛ yuɔr maac, kä cu ruath tha̱a̱k ɛmɛ cua jɛn.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
